Z||000000||ChadMan||05-09-2001||08:42 AM||||One of our salesguys stopped me in the break room this morning and told me one of his old friends is into Fieros and used to work for GM.  He claims this buddy has several Fieros and one of them is an original Super Duty Pace Car that actually ran at Indy.  I asked this guy for his friend's email address and he said he'd give it to me later today.<P>This will probably turn out to be nothing more than a fish story...the guy probably has a regular '84 Pace Car.  But I will let you know what I find out.||||reg||5
