Z||000008||ChadMan||05-09-2001||12:47 PM||||Haven't heard back from my friend downstairs yet.  I will go pester him before I leave work today.<P>Hey Oreif, when did you see the SD Pace Car at the Indy Museum?  I went in '96 and '98 and it wasn't on display.  Do they have it in storage somewhere?  If so, that would be a really cool road trip for those of us who live fairly close to Indy.  I would love to see and photograph a real Indy Pace Fiero!||||reg||1
Z||000009||Oreif||05-09-2001||01:07 PM||||It was there in 1994. If you go to a race there, it is usually in the warehouse. They only keep so many years in the front. The one at the Museum in chicago is in a big glass display section.||||reg||1
